<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Your Name | Licensed Life Insurance Agent</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Protect what matters most with personalized life insurance solutions. Term, whole, and final expense coverage options available.">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f3f4f6;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header, footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #111827; }
    main { max-width: 900px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; }
    h1 { color: #10b981; }
    .contact-form {
      background: #1e293b;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f3f4f6;
    }
    button {
      background: #10b981;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Your Name – Life Insurance</h1>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>Protect What Matters Most</h2>
    <p>I help families and individuals find the right life insurance plan — whether it’s term, whole, or final expense coverage. Let’s secure your peace of mind.</p>

    <h3>About Me</h3>
    <p>Licensed agent serving Missouri, Kentucky, and Illinois. My mission is simple: make life insurance clear, affordable, and personal.</p>

    <div class="contact-form">
      <h3>Request a Quote</h3>
      <form action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID" method="POST">
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
        <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone Number" required>
        <textarea name="message" placeholder="How can I help?" required></textarea>
        <button type="submit">Send</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© <script>document.write(new Date().getFullYear());</script> Your Name – Licensed Life Insurance Agent</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
